---
layout: base
title: Free Website Write-Up
permalink: /free-checkup/
description: Get a free short write-up of your website from a Tampa Bay tech partner, with screenshots of what we see. No charge, nothing to sign.
---

{% set checkup = null %}
{% for p in packages.all %}
  {% if p.id == "checkup" %}{% set checkup = p %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<section class="px-4 pb-8 pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-16">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free. No charge. No pressure.</p>
    <h1 class="h-display mt-4 max-w-3xl">Get your free website write-up</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-5 max-w-2xl">Send us your name, your email and your website address. We'll look at your site the way a customer would, on a phone and on a computer, and email you a short write-up with screenshots of what we see.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 pb-16 md:pb-20">
  <div class="wrap grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-5 md:gap-12">

    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <h2 class="h-section">What's in your write-up</h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        {% set writeupItems = [
          "Screenshots of what we see on your website, on a phone and on a computer",
          "The problems most likely to be costing you customers, in plain English",
          "Whether people can easily book or contact you",
          "Whether people using a screen reader or a keyboard can use your site",
          "Which fixes matter most, and which ones you can do yourself"
        ] %}
        {% for item in writeupItems %}
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="font-medium text-indigo-700">&#10003;</span>
          <span>{{ item }}</span>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 font-medium text-gray-900">It's free. No charge, and nothing to sign.</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">We reply within {{ site.responseTime }}. We only write up what we actually see on your site.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <div class="card">
        {% set formSource = "free-checkup" %}
        {% set formHeading = "Request your free write-up" %}
        {% set formButton = "Get my free website write-up" %}
        {% set showSiteUrl = true %}
        {% include "partials/lead-form.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="h-section">What happens next</h2>
    <ol class="mt-8 list-decimal space-y-4 pl-6 text-lg marker:font-medium marker:text-indigo-700">
      <li><strong>You send the form.</strong> It's short, and you can skip anything marked optional.</li>
      <li><strong>We reply within {{ site.responseTime }}</strong> to confirm we have it.</li>
      <li><strong>You get your write-up by email.</strong> It's in plain English, with screenshots of what we saw.</li>
      <li><strong>If you'd like to talk it through,</strong> we'll set up a quick call. {{ site.callHours }}. If you wouldn't, that's fine too.</li>
      <li><strong>You decide what, if anything, to do.</strong> You can fix things yourself, hire us, or do nothing.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="h-section">Want a deeper look?</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">Some owners want more than a write-up. Our free Tech Checkup is a 20-minute call plus a written report. Ask for it in the form, in the message box, and we'll set it up.</p>
    {% if checkup %}
    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
      {% for item in checkup.includes %}
      <li class="flex gap-3">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="font-medium text-indigo-700">&#10003;</span>
        <span>{{ item }}</span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-6 text-gray-700">{{ checkup.price }}. {{ checkup.timeline }}.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">The accessibility part is a technical review, not legal advice. Mobius is not a law firm.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="h-section">No strings</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">The write-up is yours whether or not you ever hire us. There's no contract to sign and no card to put down. If a fix is something you can do yourself, we'll say so.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">Would you rather talk first? <a class="link" href="/contact/">Send us a message instead</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
